#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SD1410 expect=noViolation domain=AC
#note "Boundary pinning the presence-only reading: the MCSCTIND record exists but its ACVAL is empty. The FDA message is 'Missing MCSCTIND Challenge Agent Parameter', i.e. the check is about the parameter record being present, not about its value -> no violation."
#library standard=sendig version=ar-1-0
dataset AC label="Challenge Agent Characterization"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col ACSEQ    type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col ACPARMCD type=Char label="Challenge Agent Parameter Short Name"
col ACPARM   type=Char label="Challenge Agent Parameter"
col ACVAL    type=Char label="Parameter Value"
---
S1 | AC | 1 | BACAT | Biological Agent Category | BACTERIA
S1 | AC | 2 | MCSCTIND | Multiple Challenge Agent Same Cat Ind | 
